{"id": "86339", "name": "Int_Log_1", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p>Evaluate the following integral, using a substitution if necessary: \\[ \\int \\frac{1}{{CT:0}}\\ln\\left(\\frac{{CT:1}}{{CT:0}}\\right)d{{CT:0}}\\] [[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p>", "generalfeedback": "<p>Let \\[u = \\ln\\left(\\frac{{CT:1}}{{CT:0}}\\right)\\] \\[\\frac{du}{d{{CT:0}}}=-\\frac{{CT:1}}{{CT:2}}\\frac{{CT:0}}{{CT:1}}=-\\frac{1}{{CT:0}}\\]</p>\n<p>Therefore \\[\\int\\frac{1}{{CT:0}}\\ln\\left(\\frac{{CT:1}}{{CT:0}}\\right)d{{CT:0}} = -\\int udu = -\\frac{u^2}{2} +c = -\\frac{1}{2}\\ln^2\\left(\\frac{{CT:1}}{{CT:0}}\\right) +c\\]</p>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 2, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "Int", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "correctanswer", "testoptions": " v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-0-T ", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-0-F ", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "diff(f,v)", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result